    "founder": {
      "type": "rp-founder",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Who runs this",
        "heading": "I'm not an anonymous plug",
        "text": "<p>I started reselling from my bedroom with one supplier and about £40. Everything I post in the group is something I've ordered myself first — if I haven't used it, it doesn't go in.</p><p>I'm on TikTok every week with my face on camera. If any of this were a scam, that's a strange way to run it.</p>",
        "name": "",
        "role": "Founder, Resell Plug UK",
        "cta_label": "",
        "tiktok_label": "Watch me on TikTok",
        "tiktok_link": "",
        "tone": "raised",
        "anchor": "who"
      }
    },
    "faq": {
      "type": "rp-faq",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Before you join",
        "anchor": "faq",
        "show_cta": false,
        "cta_text": "",
        "cta_label": "",
        "tone": "flat"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it actually free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. No card, no email, no trial that runs out. If you never buy anything that's completely fine — most members don't.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I know this isn't a scam?",
            "answer": "<p>Don't take my word for it. The vouches channel is public and open right now, before you spend anything. Join the free group and watch it for a week.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I've never resold anything. Is this for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes — that's most of the group. You don't need stock, a company, or money up front to learn how it works.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "qa",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens after I join?",
            "answer": "<p>Nothing is asked of you. You land in the chat, you can read the whole history, and you take what's useful. No DM, no pitch.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
